      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>A decrepit mummy is barely cohesive. Once a decrepit mummy is reduced to fewer than half their Hit Points, or immediately upon being damaged by a critical hit, they start falling apart, reducing their Armor Class to 15.</p>",
